#==============================================================================================
#
#   fetching_2 - Fetch::Fetching: main fetch
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Fetching/Fetching.cpp (lines 383-725): main fetch, its
#       get_response steps (the first matching statement of step 12) and the steps that run
#       in parallel (a deferred invocation) once the response is known: CORS-exposed header
#       names, the filtered response, the blocking checks on the response, integrity
#       metadata, and fetch response handover. Each C++ lambda is a capture struct with a
#       static function (DESIGN.md §2.7).
